{"id":"8746557b9bf84a4b","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-m-one-degrees.md","title":"many-one 度与 one-one 度","display":"df-m-one-degrees — many-one 度与 one-one 度","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-m-one-degrees","aliases":["20-df-m-one-degrees"],"display":"df-m-one-degrees — many-one 度与 one-one 度","chapter":"1","section":"1.6","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"definition-checked","source_reference":"Definition 1.6.9","source_printed_pages":[15],"source_pdf_pages":[51],"depends_on":["[[20-df-mred]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-m-one-degrees"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-m-one-degrees</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-m-one-degrees — many-one 度与 one-one 度"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.6"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-checked"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 1.6.9"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>15</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>51</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\in\\{m,1\\}\">\\(r\\in\\{m,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d5dada982b721c80\" href=\"?note=d5dada982b721c80\" title=\"20-df-mred\">20-df-mred</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}one\\text{-}degrees}\\vdash\n\\deg_r(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A\\equiv_r B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}one\\text{-}degrees}\\vdash\n\\deg_r(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A\\equiv_r B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>沿用 one-reduction 已定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_r\">\\(\\equiv_r\\)</span>，不另造同名关系。两种归约均反身且复合封闭，因此双向归约给等价关系。这里的度由指定 r 决定，不能把 m 度、1 度和 Turing 度混为同一商结构。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 1.6.9；印刷页 15；PDF 第 51 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-mred]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-mred","status":"resolved","id":"d5dada982b721c80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-mred]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"r\\in\\{m,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}m\\text{-}one\\text{-}degrees}\\vdash\n\\deg_r(A):=\\{B\\subseteq\\omega:A\\equiv_r B\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\equiv_r","display":false}],"bytes":1125,"backlinks":[{"id":"b1a3c18aaa9b0194","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-cylinder]]；see [[20-df-m-one-degrees]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]。"},{"id":"a90ed83c610b9875","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-m-one-degrees]]；see [[20-df-join]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-m-one-degrees]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-df-m-one-degrees]]"}],"outgoing":["d5dada982b721c80","1f15de2c66c6318e"]}